    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THEY ARE RISING</h2>Deep within a body, a new virus is born, and it is ready to change the world for the worst. It annihilates its bearer and transforms it. Not yet alive and yet not quite dead, the senseless body answers to a calling, a thirst for blood and flesh.<br><br>The dreaded zombies have arrived. They spread, bringing mankind's downfall with them. With rumours and videos on social media, it is no longer possible to remain blind to the problem.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/17ee2c617150c277e7e719212bd1d2ff.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/b7c767993527026271ab13a111a0ba05.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br>Unlike most other zombie culture stories, <strong>Z-Collapse</strong> emphasizes the early stages of the pandemic. How will world leaders try to limit contagion, avoid panic, manage refugees, combat hordes, or simply avoid their downfall?<br><br>It is up to you to choose among 154 available countries, and answer those questions. Your country depends upon you to survive.<br><br><strong>Z-Collapse</strong> offers a different rhythm than other strategy games. This is not a game about conquering the world, but a survival game. You will first have to tackle damage control, you will have to learn to take shots and yet stand up. After barricading yourself, and thanks to your planning and advanced technologies, you will be able to regain control of the situation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>154 playable countries</strong>. Far from all being equals. The most resilient might not be the most obvious ones.<br></li><li><strong>Resource management</strong> is necessary to the survival of your population, for base-building, and to develop an army. When they become scarce, you might have to start thinking about \u201cborrowing\u201d from your neighbors.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/0daa6815630c3a20c00af8c80b41f1de.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Bandits are rising</strong> in great numbers. Their ranks are growing strong with population panic. They will storm your facilities and will be a thorn in your thigh.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/8d2034a52b8ddbf755ce6c7dc165712f.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Refugee management</strong> from the exiled populations. You will be tasked to build refugee camps to house and protect the healthy. But do not forget they could just be extra mouths to feed.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/4f29c6ae5c95ed6c3891013d35e04dbc.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Develop technologies</strong> to shape your country. Choose among multiple domains:  military, economy, society, and science.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/065a06229600513d1a1dbe699a6980e0.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Apply political tactics</strong>: Diverting attention, mass screening, general mobilization, etc.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/0b03cb64e14666475e77264f3e41fba9.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Mobilize your army</strong> to protect your territory, or to loot resources from your neighboring countries<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/7eff6bba0a8175a5ddba03b2ba738b60.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Use Diplomacy</strong> and try to cooperate with other nations. Signing Non-aggression treaties, mutual support pacts, or trading resources<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/b9cf748c484000ff83b93ec21738d64e.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Use nuclear weapons</strong> to fight the invasion. But get ready to face the consequences...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/3842eecafc33c75699cc34d955d0dd5a.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Use special units</strong> to destabilize neighboring countries: agents to spread panic, or teams to infest new locations<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/ae919b964a700b14e90404aa2b6511b3.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Full multiplayer mode</strong> until 8 players in cooperation or PVP mode</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/page10.png?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br><br><i>As the game name has unexpectedly taken a strong symbolic meaning during the last months, I have to clarify that &quot;Z-Collapse&quot; has no relation at all with the current dramatic events in Ukraine (at least in my mind when I chose it, two years ago). The &quot;Z&quot; obviously stands for &quot;Zombies&quot;, and the &quot;Collapse&quot; is the game theme. I also obviously hope that all what happening right there now will come to an end soon.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THEY ARE RISING</h2>Deep within a body, a new virus is born, and it is ready to change the world for the worst. It annihilates its bearer and transforms it. Not yet alive and yet not quite dead, the senseless body answers to a calling, a thirst for blood and flesh.<br><br>The dreaded zombies have arrived. They spread, bringing mankind's downfall with them. With rumours and videos on social media, it is no longer possible to remain blind to the problem.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/17ee2c617150c277e7e719212bd1d2ff.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/b7c767993527026271ab13a111a0ba05.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br>Unlike most other zombie culture stories, <strong>Z-Collapse</strong> emphasizes the early stages of the pandemic. How will world leaders try to limit contagion, avoid panic, manage refugees, combat hordes, or simply avoid their downfall?<br><br>It is up to you to choose among 154 available countries, and answer those questions. Your country depends upon you to survive.<br><br><strong>Z-Collapse</strong> offers a different rhythm than other strategy games. This is not a game about conquering the world, but a survival game. You will first have to tackle damage control, you will have to learn to take shots and yet stand up. After barricading yourself, and thanks to your planning and advanced technologies, you will be able to regain control of the situation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>154 playable countries</strong>. Far from all being equals. The most resilient might not be the most obvious ones.<br></li><li><strong>Resource management</strong> is necessary to the survival of your population, for base-building, and to develop an army. When they become scarce, you might have to start thinking about \u201cborrowing\u201d from your neighbors.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/0daa6815630c3a20c00af8c80b41f1de.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Bandits are rising</strong> in great numbers. Their ranks are growing strong with population panic. They will storm your facilities and will be a thorn in your thigh.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/8d2034a52b8ddbf755ce6c7dc165712f.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Refugee management</strong> from the exiled populations. You will be tasked to build refugee camps to house and protect the healthy. But do not forget they could just be extra mouths to feed.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/4f29c6ae5c95ed6c3891013d35e04dbc.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Develop technologies</strong> to shape your country. Choose among multiple domains:  military, economy, society, and science.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/065a06229600513d1a1dbe699a6980e0.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Apply political tactics</strong>: Diverting attention, mass screening, general mobilization, etc.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804500/extras/0b03cb64e14666475e77264f3e41fba9.avif?t=1667036870\" /></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Mobilize your army</strong> to protect your territory, or to loot resources from your neighboring countries<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img